      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ماجدهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجَادٌ</span>, <i>He vied,</i> or <i>competed,
with him</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَارَضَهُ</span>) <i>in</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْد</span> [or <i>glory, honour,
dignity, nobility, &amp;c.</i>]. (L, K.) You say,
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاجَدْتُهُ فَمَجَدْتُهُ</span></b> , (aor. of the latter 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجُدَ</span></b> , S, L,) <i>I
vied, &amp;c., with him in glory, &amp;c., and overcame
him therein.</i> (S, L, K.)


